{"id":"995ecc84148b23a31b95d00502f20f16673cd30a","axis":"silent","repo":"ckeditor/ckeditor5","sha":"995ecc84148b23a31b95d00502f20f16673cd30a","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changelog/20261103090000_cc_12592.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@","+---","+type: Fix","+scope:","+  - ckeditor5-ui","+  - ckeditor5-editor-classic","+  - ckeditor5-fullscreen","+  - ckeditor5-style","+  - ckeditor5-table","+  - ckeditor5-special-characters","+  - ckeditor5-link","+---","+","+Theme token overrides now reach a few UI parts that ignored them:","+","+* The classic editor editing area border and the fullscreen page follow `--ck-editor-frame-border-color` and `--ck-editor-editable-background`. A theme that sets `--ck-color-border-container` or `--ck-color-surface-canvas` to a custom value also changes them.","+* The style grid buttons follow `--ck-color-surface-canvas` on hover and press, and their backgrounds can be set with `--ck-style-panel-button-hover-background`, `--ck-style-panel-button-active-background`, and `--ck-style-panel-button-disabled-background`.","+* The table properties error balloon follows the error and inverse text roles: `--ck-table-properties-error-background` and `--ck-table-properties-error-text-color`.","+* Declared tokens with the current defaults for colors that had only a raw fallback: the color grid check icon (`--ck-color-grid-check-icon-color`), the blurred editing area selection (`--ck-editor-editable-blurred-selection-background`), the accessibility help dialog (`--ck-accessibility-help-dialog-code-background-color`, `--ck-accessibility-help-dialog-kbd-shadow-color`, and `--ck-accessibility-help-dialog-border-color`, which falls back to `--ck-color-divider`), and the linked image badge (`--ck-link-image-indicator-background-color`)."],"additions":18,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/updating/migration-to-refreshed-theme.md","lines":["@@ -216,6 +216,11 @@ Save the aliases block below as your own file and load it between the editor CSS"," \t-